                        {
                          "id": "c74e8569-6e23-4e9b-b522-b5dcec080fe0",
                          "name": "The response contains (a) criteria (the search criteria in the request), and (b) results (list of applications with the component specified).\n\nEach result includes applicationId and application name containing the component, the relative and absoluteURLs ",
                          "originalRequest": {
                            "method": "GET",
                            "header": [
